  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_LEGACY_OF_KINGS": "Legacy of Kings",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_LEGACY_OF_KINGS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: your leader gains a trait it lacks, of your choice: Aggressive, Spiritual, Expansive, Industrious, Creative, Financial, Organized, Charismatic, Arcane or Raiders.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The trait is permanent: the Adaptive and Insane trait changes keep it.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_LEGACY_OF_KINGS_PEDIA": "The bards remember what the old kings were, and a ruler who hears them becomes it.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_LEGACY_OF_KINGS": "Legacy of Kings",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_LEGACY_OF_KINGS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]The target: a trait your leader lacks, of Aggressive, Spiritual, Expansive, Industrious, Creative, Financial, Organized, Charismatic, Arcane and Raiders.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Your leader gains it for good: the Adaptive and Insane trait changes keep it."
  }
